# The licensed match data must NEVER be committed.
#
# The More Than A Hack 2027 competition data is licensed to the teams that downloaded it
# and may not be redistributed. Only the checksums travel with the repository: see
# MANIFEST.sha256. A reviewer verifies their own download with
#
#     cd data && shasum -a 256 -c ../MANIFEST.sha256
#
data/*
!data/README.md

# Generated outputs: the submission, the run report and the debug trace.
artifacts/
reports/
scoreboard*/
*scoreboard*.csv

